OL,3,AFrance launches attempted murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation after petrol bomb thrown
OL,5,Aat police
OL,6,
OL,7,FProsecutors in France have launched an
OL,8,Fattempted murder investigation after
OL,9,Fpetrol bombs were thrown at police
OL,10,Fduring unrest, French media reported.
OL,12,FAn image of a police officer with his
OL,13,Fleg on fire during a clash with
OL,14,Fprotesters in Paris on Saturday has
OL,15,Fprompted outrage and follows weeks of
OL,16,Fstreet protests in France that have
OL,17,Falso seen demonstrators injured.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
