OL,3,AFrance launches attempted murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation after petrol bomb thrown
OL,5,Aat police
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe officer, who suffered burns to his
OL,8,Fankle and minor injures to his hand,
OL,9,Ftold French newspaper Le Figaro it was
OL,10,Fa "particularly sophisticated"
OL,11,Fincendiary device.
OL,13,FInterior Minister Laurent Nunez said
OL,14,Fthrowing a molotov cocktail at a police
OL,15,Fline was "what I call a murder
OL,16,Fattempt", adding officers were working
OL,17,Fto find the perpetrators.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
